          "body": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\" data-start=\"163\" data-end=\"239\"><strong data-start=\"163\" data-end=\"182\"><img src=\"https://ttf-public.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/XXTGFC9ljM6sXLCXvSy32gQeoFaEvDgU5BJZCLXFlpUQRSZqSy7sNy4y8owCeyEQ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"437\"></strong></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\" data-start=\"163\" data-end=\"239\"><strong data-start=\"163\" data-end=\"182\">GITANO BEACH NYE 2027</strong><br data-start=\"182\" data-end=\"185\">A new year. A new chapter. A night you won&rsquo;t forget.</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-start=\"163\" data-end=\"239\">Hosted at <strong data-start=\"201\" data-end=\"217\">GITANO BEACH</strong>, our beautiful beachfront club and restaurant nestled in the most exclusive part of <strong data-start=\"302\" data-end=\"317\">South Tulum</strong>, known for its <strong data-start=\"333\" data-end=\"351\">pristine beach</strong> and <strong>Renowned DJ performances.</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-start=\"241\" data-end=\"380\">We can&rsquo;t reveal much (yet), just that this night will be EPIC!</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-start=\"241\" data-end=\"380\">Pre-sale tickets are now live &mdash; secure your place before the rest of the world catches on.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-start=\"297\" data-end=\"584\"><strong>Reserve tickets according to your party size to ensure you&rsquo;re seated together.</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"699\" data-end=\"768\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-start=\"241\" data-end=\"380\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: center;\" data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"535\">NYE 2027 &mdash; The countdown begins!</h5>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-start=\"241\" data-end=\"380\"><img src=\"https://ttf-public.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/yfsHOe5j4hL8CKCji8rGpQNITyxSgT7EBuIb2fYzwGNDJaGZNVTgGxrqghL120V6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"329\" height=\"153\"></p>\n<h6 style=\"text-a